# Windows batch and PowerShell files MUST check out with CRLF.
#
# cmd.exe mis-parses an LF-only .bat: every `REM` line in forward_test/run_snapshot.bat
# emitted "'M' is not recognized as an internal or external command" to the wrapper's
# OWN stderr, which nothing captured -- the log only ever received python's redirected
# output. Silent parse errors in the job that records the forward test is exactly the
# class of failure this repo has already been bitten by, so pin the endings rather than
# relying on core.autocrlf being set the same way on every machine.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Everything else: normalise to LF in the repo, let git decide on checkout.
* text=auto
